cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DYNAMIXEL-X430-Control-Table-Emulator in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DYNAMIXEL-X430-Control-Table-Emulator"
abstract: >-
  Device-side emulation of ROBOTIS DYNAMIXEL X430 actuators over Protocol 2.0 in portable
  C11: the Control Tables of all 17 X430 models and the rules of the real devices, so that
  firmware driving any motor appears to DynamixelSDK, DYNAMIXEL Wizard and ROS 2 as a
  genuine X430. No heap, no RTOS, MISRA C:2012, 100 % test coverage.
authors:
